Package: ocsessnotify
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Tim Hosking <munger@mungerware.com>
Depends: avahi-daemon, avahi-utils, curl, jq
Description: Post a message to the most recent opencode session
 Provides the ocsessnotify command for sending a message to the most
 recently active opencode session, discovered on the LAN via mDNS.
 Supports targeting a specific server port and/or session ID.
